== Trivia ==
* There is a bookshelf at {{coordinates|-10|127|-938}} in the {{zone|Cathedral}}, which if the player has over {{stat|int|4,000}}, it will give the following message: {{rmt|&aYou use your mana to pull a book out. Most of it is unreadable but you do notice a 2 and a 22...}}
**The 2 and 22 can be inserted into the [[Kuudra Archeologist|Kuudra Archeologist's]] math equation to get <math>\int_{2}^{22} 2x - 2x^5 + 7x^3 dx</math>, which gives the coordinates to find the {{Item|Kuudra Relic}} at {{coordinates|-373|82|-880}}.
*According to lore, the '''Cathedral''' has now been repurposed as a university, as no one from {{zone|Scarleton}} ever went to pray anymore.

